        "candidate_id": "C_c6846ec4a8e30122_0",
        "edit": "Replace the duplicated case item 3'b110 with 3'b111 so the case covers ABC=3'b111 and produces X=1,Y=0 for ABC=7, matching the oracle at cycle7.",
